{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1b297bce7ef8a49579e759e63710e419129733a6f6ed5db421b84989c3eef1a5", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのオーディションは\n順調に進んでいる。さて、次はどんな子かな？）", "zh": "（39PROJECT的成员甄选进行得十分顺利。\n让我来看看，下一位又会是怎么样的人呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "e3e39f008ed5b5b3769ebb76d6f9be89490def37c6034abb3f28df1b78434fe8", "ja": "失礼します。\n北沢志保です。今日はよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "打扰了。\n我叫做北泽志保，今天请多多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b4acd1db690b3bdadf472c971e0484819670cf042ef1666542a606ecd3cdda06", "ja": "こちらこそ、よろしく。早速だけど、君はどうして、\nこのオーディションに応募してくれたのかな？", "zh": "彼此彼此，请多指教。马上切入正题吧，\n可以说说你为何会报名本次甄选吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "64a884ccf6337aaf0a71c16f84e0e797233bf394e370cebecb4bb0938d25870b", "ja": "はい。仕事がしたいからです。", "zh": "好的。因为我想要就业。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cde70e898607f42d05e51ba2717a0d5fb6efebbbf9eaa5fbcec6ec48e8779a7d", "ja": "えっ？　仕事がしたいって……。\nつまり、働きたいってこと？", "zh": "咦？你想要就业……\n你是说，你想找工作的意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "daaae21081dd0a4f50fd35994abdfbb68f08bdfeb874b52206331ba8cf074980", "ja": "はい。……ダメですか？", "zh": "是的……请问这样不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "361850d4b911dab5a79ebef1874f9ab58c417434a5d432493e766620991bad57", "ja": "いや、ダメじゃないけど。\n理由を聞いてもいいかな。", "zh": "不，当然可以。\n但你能说说是为什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "1d47ee9aaadfb9c42d9cc7625daf48a05fbdf2e3be625a23f0112cd757631468", "ja": "早く働いて、母に楽をさせたいと思ったからです。", "zh": "我想要赶快开始工作，才能减轻母亲的负担。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "59df73efeb9b92241983a88b7bb0fe645ddcfc2861f9eea799a08b7ef269298f", "ja": "うちは母子家庭なので。\n私が何もしないのは、もったいないと思って。", "zh": "因为我家是单亲家庭，\n我不帮忙分担家计的话就太浪费了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "652b616ae1724a1c3ff4ebf357eb5e9a183e3295431876248fbe41aab24f871d", "ja": "それに、私が働いた分、母が家にいられるようになれば\n……弟も、母に甘えられますし。", "zh": "而且要是我工作能让母亲减轻负担，更常待在家里……\n如此一来，弟弟就能得到母亲的陪伴了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a7f74b9e0282b00311c6fc57ccbf0f23e768e34e3aa0594bb6882f0dd0658d26", "ja": "なるほど……。\nちなみに、北沢さんはいくつだっけ。", "zh": "原来如此……\n对了，北泽小姐，你今年几岁呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "98d55b2849cd8796df4a36f2673909a1ef727de9b966204a548d5f842f5990b0", "ja": "14歳です。", "zh": "我今年14岁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2402370128fb3921e8f67e8173fcfdb11fb313bf30caa4e0fc82af4163f02897", "ja": "（14歳で、そこまで考えてるのか。\n責任感が、人一倍強いのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（才14岁就有这么成熟的想法吗？\n看来她的责任感或许超乎常人。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "25121298747415e7cd671c9733198f327043529ab619b305cdde7ce29652ba8a", "ja": "でも、ただ働きたいってことなら、\n何もアイドルじゃなくてもいいと思うんだけど？", "zh": "不过，如果只是想要工作，\n应该不是非当偶像不可吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "7cde0ceeeef5b974312c9925aabcdf6de1156cfb11f500f77ee67eaf71de79f7", "ja": "……それは……。", "zh": "……这是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "31cb6f491a1b848bc4d9f361e98f917ceef55147a2f1e694ad05d65cd50b6d83", "ja": "手伝いをしたくても、14歳じゃまだ働けません。\nだからです。", "zh": "即便我想帮忙负担家计，但我才14岁，\n很难找到其他工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "025a1136c39178f46edb4412bfbf0e0c5665c5cec383b6aebd25e1dc9463e604", "ja": "ああ、確かに。\n14歳じゃ、働くのは難しいか……。", "zh": "也是，的确是这样。\n14岁能做的工作不好找……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3e5b32b09f49504edfb3d9b23be0b401e6a85bf5d234f793061020e7adf1b14a", "ja": "じゃあ君は、お母さんを助けるために、\nアイドルになりたいんだね？", "zh": "所以结论就是，你为了减轻母亲的负担，\n所以才想当偶像啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "ee561ae8d4de2f748c5fe5aba66a9f95f7ddf9fbd76576a73789a52130f9b485", "ja": "い、いえ。\n……それだけじゃありません。", "zh": "不、不是的。\n……并不单单是因为那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "31683c5237d14c5141756b71f490a64870fe63fd8d48b6fea36603c97f83461b", "ja": "小さい頃に、初めてTVでアイドルを見ました。\n衣装が素敵で、歌もダンスも、華やかで……。", "zh": "我小时候第一次在电视上看到偶像时，\n觉得服装好漂亮，歌舞表演也好绚丽……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "293dc3c42825077734957dc4357414ab1a433bcc23c9bf0d87f35375b69f1378", "ja": "その……。\n絵本の中の、お姫様みたいだな、って……。", "zh": "我觉得……\n就像是绘本里的公主一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c4851b841a10e25205926cf3d1be324ebdbc729cc10fc03a0c17ea80752a0798", "ja": "（……なんだ。\nしっかりアイドルに、憧れを持っているんじゃないか）", "zh": "（……什么嘛。\n原来她心里还是对偶像怀有向往的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1023_p", "source_sha256": "891d67c946148d7b89c35ae63d237e10241b089175699bb4ec6f9ad0a20a1f50", "ja": "（そして、この覚悟……）", "zh": "（再加上如此坚定的决心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_1024", "source_sha256": "7f8354a6527db909d196ec480e15d6a619dba6369e42758706f5d9526ae4c968", "ja": "合格！", "zh": "录取！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "fb94e56c73a58e8d90a3c09cd2d3e473fca5e5cb6ba85dea0f2115299a9ca4d0", "ja": "北沢志保さん、合格だ！　これから\n39プロジェクトのアイドルとして、一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "北泽志保小姐，你录取了！\n以后你就是39PROJECT的偶像，一起奋斗吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_2001_033sih", "source_sha256": "935b25377b1baaaea6a90b0b00991a3bb066ee483c796d62940457afd2a073b1", "ja": "えっ？\n合格って……。", "zh": "咦？\n我录取了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_2002_033sih", "source_sha256": "2bcaf0aafe2275dd89327626318e55fdf032ca4e6940de903b4d49b86cbdc297", "ja": "こんなにあっさり？\n本当に、いいんですか？", "zh": "这么干脆就录取了吗？\n请问这样真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_2003_p", "source_sha256": "f797dd598cd5f6914883f2e0486fb0dbdedf18d696a0ec4aa2e9b8666504245d", "ja": "合格と言っても、まだスタートラインに立っただけだ。\n本当に大変なのは、これからだよ。", "zh": "录取其实也只是站上起跑点罢了。\n接下来才真正要开始辛苦哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_2004_033sih", "source_sha256": "77777e752e022c0a665ae3ad029f2c92003b526004e7c85323fbe6691c048963", "ja": "これから……。そうですね。\nプロデューサーさんの、言う通りだと思います。", "zh": "接下来……说得也是。\n我也认为制作人先生说得没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_2005_033sih", "source_sha256": "f1bfe6b55bc1e518500b0b593ef363d751f3be4167e0530d26d1c98de8a18987", "ja": "でも、これで……\nスタートラインには……。", "zh": "不过，至少……\n我已经站上起跑点了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_2006_p", "source_sha256": "5dd8ac1fd6f6131aa459a8caab965f4838ee6703fcaad43ae11f3c3545bff599", "ja": "アイドルの世界は厳しいぞ！\nしっかりサポートするから、頑張っていこう。", "zh": "偶像世界是很严苛的喔！\n我会好好协助你的，加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_2007_033sih", "source_sha256": "d79e83ef225604753cee582617d9c70ea8929dbf1e21dcccb83943436f56c0be", "ja": "はい、望むところです。\nこちらこそ、これからよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "好的，我求之不得。\n我才要请你今后多多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_2008_033sih", "source_sha256": "541c9dd875ef75d99fb8667be670c2c9dcc713b95a5bd99fc4aef7295c36c583", "ja": "えっと……。", "zh": "请问……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_2009_p", "source_sha256": "8ff20bf169d0e18d80b7339760d755b9bd8424be553cb2a65503bdfc2f13376e", "ja": "ああ、名刺を渡してなかったね。\nこれが俺の名前だ、改めてよろしく！", "zh": "我都忘了，还没给你名片。\n这是我的名字，再次请你多多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_2010_033sih", "source_sha256": "a10647bdd948593c33fa2ca90442e8516b24e9ecaea4c3145ce916ffcc8daf9b", "ja": "はい、よろしくお願いします。\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "好的，请多指教。\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_2011_p", "source_sha256": "4720e5520f7cb80ebc24168c6282df8e93db56fb8bd59a0e0ba6958b8787a3ba", "ja": "（家族を思う優しさ、そして\n大人びた態度の中に見え隠れする、少女の顔……）", "zh": "（为家人着想的体贴温柔，\n以及故作成熟的态度中不时窥见的少女情怀……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_001_2012_p", "source_sha256": "3c03f899aca3dbdbc5c2b48a44afa62ce6348dc1cd719119d87fa4a7bb437bc9", "ja": "（この子には、まだまだ他にも魅力が隠れていそうだ。\nそれをしっかり引き出していこう！）", "zh": "（这女孩应该还有许多深藏不露的魅力。\n我要好好帮她挖掘出来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
